    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><strong>Revolutionize Content Creation with Draggable Content Blocks</strong></p>\n<p>The Draggable Content Block is a specialized WordPress gutenberg block that introduces a single, powerful feature: a completely draggable content element for the Gutenberg editor. Unlike other bloated drag-and-drop solutions, this plugin focuses on doing one thing exceptionally well &#8211; giving you complete control over badge placement with intuitive drag functionality.</p>\n<h3>Key features include:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Only the badge element itself is draggable &#8211; no other content is affected</li>\n<li>Drag your badge to exact positions with smooth, precise movement</li>\n<li>Customizable content blocks that can contain text, images, videos or other media</li>\n<li>Block settings to control appearance and behavior</li>\n<li>Smooth animations and positioning</li>\n<li>Compatible with all modern browsers</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use Draggable Content</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the Draggable Content plugin from the WordPress dashboard.</li>\n<li>Add the Draggable Content from the block category called &#8220;widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>User Feedback</h3>\n<h4>&#8211; Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:support@bplugins.com\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></h4>\n<h3>⭐ Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">B Blocks</a></strong> – Best gutenberg blocks collections for WordPress.</p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Best audio player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Best video player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – A fully-featured PDF Viewer Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/document-embedder\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Document Embedder</a></strong> – Best WordPress Document Embedder Plugin.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models on the webs.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Advanced Post Block</a></strong> – Best Post Display Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h3>From Gutenberg Editor:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor</li>\n<li>Search For <strong>Draggable Content</strong></li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Draggable Content</strong> to add the block</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Download &amp; Upload:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>Draggable Content</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>)</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to the Plugins menu and click on <strong>Add New</strong></li>\n<li>Click on <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> and choose the <strong><code>draggable-content.zip</code></strong> file and click on <strong>Install Now</strong></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin and Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Manually:</h3>\n<ol>\n<li>Download and upload the <strong>Draggable Content</strong> plugin to the <strong><code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></strong> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F\">\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F\">\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20a%20block%3F\">\nHow many times can I reuse a block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use unlimited times as you want.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F\">\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/draggable-content/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1 &#8211; 13 Oct 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Advanced options</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
